<codeline><highlight class="normal">you<sp/>will<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>have<sp/>the<sp/>C++<sp/>toolset<sp/>installed,<sp/>along<sp/>with<sp/>MFC.<sp/><sp/>As<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>command-line<sp/>application,<sp/>I&apos;ve<sp/>verified</highlight></codeline>
