<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>the<sp/>&apos;code&apos;<sp/>directory,<sp/>there<sp/>are<sp/>the<sp/>following<sp/>items:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;ul&gt;</highlight></codeline>
